# Tributary Vaulter: "Flying. Whenever this creature becomes tapped, another target Merfolk you control gets +2/+0 until end of
# turn." Bot1's Vaulter (1/3 flier) attacks on turn 3; its trigger refuses an Ornithopter (not a Merfolk), the Vaulter itself
# ("another") and Bot2's Wanderbrine Preacher (a Merfolk, but Bot2's), and gives one of Bot1's two Preachers +2/+0 (4/2, toughness
# unchanged) while the other stays 2/2. On turn 5 the pumped Preacher is a 2/2 again.

